[h1]⚙️ Commands++[/h1]
Modular, persistent chat commands for Superfighters Deluxe.

Everything is organized into modules that can be individually allowed or restricted to the host and your choices are remembered between sessions via local storage.

[b]This description is a summary. For the full command list and further information, visit the [url=https://github.com/MythoFame/SFD.Scripting.CommandsPlusPlus]GitHub page[/url].[/b]

Use [b]/modules[/b] to see all modules, [b]/commands [module][/b] to browse help, and [b]/toggle_module[/b] to control them.

Required parameters are shown with <>, optional with [], choices with {}.

[h2]🧩 Modules[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Management:[/b] The control center. Browse commands and manage other modules. Always available.
[*][b]Automation:[/b] Schedule commands to run on events (startup, shutdown, gameover, spawn, timers, manual). Host only.
[*][b]Gameplay:[/b] Persistent rules like respawns, gravity, friendly fire and more. Host only.
[*][b]Spectation:[/b] Choose who plays and who watches. Ideal for lobbies and tournaments.
[*][b]Player:[/b] Moderator tools to directly control players, their gear and movement.
[*][b]Fun:[/b] Light-hearted extras and visual gags.
[/list]
